{
"file": 126,
"paths": [
"d007/d004/f193"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "2a5cb673",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sakai, how'd it go?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "ab4febd6",
"en_raw": "...The Sakaue Jizo fortune results"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "5aa85b41",
"en_raw": "Totally like the rumor"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "12bdc4a5",
"en_raw": "When I turned around from the right"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "91579a12",
"en_raw": "a familiar figure was standing there"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "f61ea10e",
"en_raw": "...Who was it?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "a5dc7b1f",
"en_raw": "...Nishi"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "7cd82fcc",
"en_raw": "I thought"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "1f28eb98",
"en_raw": "my heart would stop"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "747ccb48",
"en_raw": "That's no coincidence"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "2a5ceeed",
"en_raw": "You two really are fated"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "ce5da554",
"en_raw": "to be together"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "9998e05e",
"en_raw": "...Fate, huh"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "38670348",
"en_raw": "I wonder if it'll become"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "4ef7aa6d",
"en_raw": "another weird rumor?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "dc6b2c7b",
"en_raw": "You'd better be"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "caec22db",
"en_raw": "prepared"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "ca7a4283",
"en_raw": "After all"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "83ffdb43",
"en_raw": "he's that Nishi"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "6c9a89ec",
"en_raw": "Geez, Yuri, you're mean"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "30eb1b04",
"en_raw": "Uh-oh"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "50946947",
"en_raw": "The otaku girl is here"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "8d0b0799",
"en_raw": "Fated to be together..."
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "4125f678",
"en_raw": "How serious are you?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "8311e0b3",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi, if you spread it around"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "e3a14ac8",
"en_raw": "I won't forgive you"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "f0d8e0ea",
"en_raw": "Is that okay?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "4dee7b70",
"en_raw": "You look like you're dying"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "4ffea6d1",
"en_raw": "to brag, though"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "decd7215",
"en_raw": "Yuri, ignore her"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "e6ca4e50",
"en_raw": "Telling someone like this"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "e1d326ca",
"en_raw": "about your future partner is pointless"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "b38bd277",
"en_raw": "There's no way to know"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "9ce6cde0",
"en_raw": "your future partner"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "3fb6e2fb",
"en_raw": "Besides, humanity"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "3443ad19",
"en_raw": "will perish next month"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "d6985e4b",
"en_raw": "...Then, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "c462503b",
"en_raw": "turn around from the left"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "1f6c74b7",
"en_raw": "at the Sakaue Jizo"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "74c5112f",
"en_raw": "and you'll meet your future self"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "824a6a13",
"en_raw": "Well, it's up to you not to believe"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "31ed29a7",
"en_raw": "Obtained the rumor of the Sakaue Jizo"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "2e70771e",
"en_raw": "It's strange to me"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "8bb7c43e",
"en_raw": "how you can believe"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "e7aae0f8",
"en_raw": "such stories so easily"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "7f556154",
"en_raw": "Sorry, I don't want to waste"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "dd2179d3",
"en_raw": "any more time"
}
]
}